color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Staff Selection Commission (SSC)</b></span></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"color: #008000;\">SSC Delhi Police Constable Driver Recruitment 2025</span></b></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>SSC Delhi Police Constable Driver Exam 2025: Short Details of Notification</b></span></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b></b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\" width=\"347\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span><b></b></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Application Begin :<b> 24/09/2025</b></li>\n<li>Last Date for Apply Online :<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b>15/10/2025</b></span></li>\n<li>Last Date Pay Exam Fee :<b>16/10/2025</b></li>\n<li>Correction Date : <strong>23-25 October 2025</strong></li>\n<li>Self Slot Booking: <strong>05 to 10 December 2025</strong></li>\n<li>Exam Date 2025: <strong>16-17 December 2025 </strong></li>\n<li>Admit Card Available : <b>14/12/2025</b></li>\n<li>Answer Key Available :<strong> 31/12/2025</strong></li>\n<li>Result Released Date: <strong>29/04/2026</strong></li>\n<li>Marks Available: <strong>27/05/2026</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"273\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span><b></b></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>General / OBC / EWS : <b>100/-</b></li>\n<li>SC / ST : <b>0/-</b></li>\n<li>All Category Female : <b>0/-</b></li>\n<li>Pay the Examination Fee Through Cast at E Challan or Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking<b> </b></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"14\" valign=\"top\" width=\"620\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>SSC Delhi Police Constable Driver Notification 2025 : <span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\">Age Limit as on </span></b><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>01/07/2025</b></span></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Minimum Age :<strong> 21 Years</strong></li>\n<li>Maximum Age : <strong>30 Years</strong></li>\n<li>Age Relaxation Extra as per SSC Delhi Police Constable Driver Recruitment Rules.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"14\" valign=\"top\" width=\"620\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>SSC Delhi Police Constable Driver Recruitment 2025: <span style=\"color: #008000;\">Vacancy Details </span></b><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Total : 737 Post</b></span></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"125\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Post Name</b></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"159\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Total Post</b></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\" width=\"336\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>SSC Delhi Police Constable Driver Eligibility</b></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"125\">\n<p align=\"center\">SSC Delhi Police Constable Driver</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"159\">\n<p align=\"center\">737 Post</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\" width=\"336\">\n<ul>\n<li>10+2 Intermediate Passed from Any Recognized Board</li>\n<li>Male Candidate : HMV Driving License.</li>\n<li>Male : PET Details</li>\n<li>Height : 170 CMS</li>\n<li>More Eligibility Details Read the Notification.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"14\" valign=\"top\" width=\"620\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>SSC Delhi Police Constable Driver Exam 2025: <span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\">Category Wise Vacancy Details</span></b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"186\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Post Name</b></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"95\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><b>General</b></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"77\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>EWS</b></p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"76\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>OBC</b></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"55\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>SC</b></p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"59\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>ST</b></p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"73\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Total</b></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"186\">SSC Delhi Police Constable Driver</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"95\">351</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"77\">73</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"76\">170</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"55\">87</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"59\">56</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"73\"><strong>737</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"14\" valign=\"top\" width=\"620\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>How to Fill SSC Delhi Police Constable Driver Recruitment Online Form 2025</b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>SSC Delhi Police Constable Driver Recruitment for Various Post Candidate Can Apply Between <strong>24/09/2025 to 15/10/2025</strong></li>\n<li>Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Recruitment Application Form in SSC Delhi Police Constable Driver Recruitment 2025.</li>\n<li>Kindly Check and Collect the All Document – Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</li>\n<li>Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form – Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</li>\n<li>Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</li>\n<li>If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</li>\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"14\" valign=\"top\" width=\"620\"><center><br>\n<!-- 300 x 250 mar 23 --><br>\n<br>\n</center><p></p>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>In